== Quest Start ==
Talk to Magus Frinon in the [[Plane of Sky]].

You say, 'Hail, Magus Frinon'
:''Magus Frinon says, 'Greetings, Tify.  Have you come here to [test your abilities] as a magician?' ''
You say, 'test your abilities'
:''Magus Frinon says, 'I am glad to hear that.  Please, let me know what you would like instruction in?  I can offer help with [clarification], [interpretation], and [gesticulation]. I can also provide you with tests for [empowerment], [shielding], [summoning], and [displacement].' ''

== Magician Test of Clarification ==

You say, 'clarification'
:''Magus Frinon says, 'Clarification it is.  Proceed upward through the sky and return to me a feathered cape and a wind rune lena.  This will prove your abilities to me and I will reward you with the Bracelet of Clarification.' ''

